  "description": "By-party returns the statements whose issuance names the party as @producer and the acts whose @party is the party; by-source returns the communication's statements and the acts sourced from it. Expectations are not statements, an addressee is not a party, and the recording operator is neither a party nor a source. A document-sourced act without @basis or @issuance is still accepted (3.2.1 is not write-validated).",
